{"file": "穿越六零之我在山洞闷声发家-第144集.mp4", "ep": 144, "duration": 59.8, "segments": [{"start": 0.02, "end": 1.82, "text": "食堂也快撑不住了"}, {"start": 1.82, "end": 3.82, "text": "厂领导天天催凉"}, {"start": 3.82, "end": 5.82, "text": "我今天也是来碰碰运气"}, {"start": 5.82, "end": 7.22, "text": "仿之厂"}, {"start": 7.22, "end": 9.56, "text": "又一个大客户"}, {"start": 9.56, "end": 10.76, "text": "倒是有一批"}, {"start": 10.76, "end": 11.56, "text": "多少"}, {"start": 11.56, "end": 13.16, "text": "三千斤左右的仓粮"}, {"start": 13.16, "end": 14.76, "text": "以红薯土豆为主"}, {"start": 14.76, "end": 17.16, "text": "另外还有几百斤野猪肉"}, {"start": 17.16, "end": 20.0, "text": "三千斤"}, {"start": 20.0, "end": 21.0, "text": "还有肉"}, {"start": 21.0, "end": 22.0, "text": "我要"}, {"start": 22.0, "end": 22.8, "text": "全要"}, {"start": 22.8, "end": 23.4, "text": "兄弟"}, {"start": 23.4, "end": 24.86, "text": "你开价"}, {"start": 24.86, "end": 26.46, "text": "红薯土豆一块八"}, {"start": 26.46, "end": 27.86, "text": "野猪肉两块二"}, {"start": 27.86, "end": 28.66, "text": "成"}, {"start": 28.66, "end": 30.72, "text": "可这么多货"}, {"start": 30.72, "end": 31.92, "text": "怎么交接"}, {"start": 32.12, "end": 33.92, "text": "我来安排地方和时间"}, {"start": 33.92, "end": 36.12, "text": "你们倒是验货结账拉走就行"}, {"start": 36.12, "end": 36.92, "text": "行"}, {"start": 36.92, "end": 37.92, "text": "还有一点"}, {"start": 37.92, "end": 39.32, "text": "别把场面弄得太大"}, {"start": 39.32, "end": 39.92, "text": "明白"}, {"start": 39.92, "end": 46.23, "text": "明白"}, {"start": 46.23, "end": 47.83, "text": "机械厂一条线"}, {"start": 47.83, "end": 50.12, "text": "仿之厂又一条线"}, {"start": 50.12, "end": 51.12, "text": "这一趟"}, {"start": 51.12, "end": 57.03, "text": "没白来"}, {"start": 57.03, "end": 58.63, "text": "三千斤粗粮"}, {"start": 58.63, "end": 59.63, "text": "几百斤肉"}]}